{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は名古屋全握\nそしてそして\nせいらりん生誕祭！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも通りレポです(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/2683176/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多くのかたが来てくださいました(*^^*)\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/2683176/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天気は暑すぎるくらい晴れました(・∀・)\nかなりんご病な！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなりんとひめたんは\n学業のためお休み＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のMCはまりちゃとひなちま！\n今回のMCはこないだ立候補して\nその中からあみだくじで決めました(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/2683176/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"overture\nおいでシャンプー\n狼に口笛を\nハウス！\n乃木坂の詩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプーのれなりんのアンダーは\nまいまいが\nハウス！のれなりんのアンダーは\n飛鳥が\nやってくれました！\nありがとう(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初披露のハウス！\nどうだった？好きって届いた？｀・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと\n狼に口笛を にも出させていただきました！\n何人かのブログに書いてあったけど\n中田はこないだレッスン中\n狼に口笛を を見て感動してしまいました(;_;)\nで、自分もどうしてもやりたくて\nひめたんのアンダーとして\n出させていただきました○┓\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/2683176/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりん生誕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わり\n...と思ったら\nここでメンバーからサプライズ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキ登場！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんHappyBirthday"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/2683176/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日おめでとう(*^^*)\nらりんはね〜\n話とかしっかりまじめに聞いてくれてるし\nらりんが笑ってれば癒される＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンをほんと大事にしてるし\nらりんを推せた人は幸せだと思うんだ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんのくしゃくしゃな笑顔は世界を救う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田とか実際\nらりんが大好きなんですよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/2683176/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくね(´｀*）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/2683176/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にぎにぎ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第３レーン\nいこまちゃんとみなみと中田の\n3人でした(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のぐるカーのときより\n全然多くのかたが来てくださって\nほんと嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/2683176/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんほんと来てくださって\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/2683176/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプーで名古屋に来れるのは\n今日だけでしたが＞＜\nでも楽しかったから\nまた次会えるのを楽しみにしてますね"},{"type":"image","src":